DTSTART:20261109T000000Z
DTEND:20261109T020000Z
SUMMARY:Night Time Glow Paddle
LOCATION:The Boathouse at WaterColor\, WaterColor\, Santa Rosa Beach\, FL
DESCRIPTION:Clear Kayaks with lights underneath!\nConveniently located at t
 he WaterColor Boathouse in 30A\, our rentals are perfect for all ages. Unf
 orgettable memories and family fun are guaranteed on this one of a kind ex
 perience.\nWe offer different time slots available at 6 PM\, 7 PM\, 8 PM\,
  and 9 PM. To book your Glow Paddle adventure and for more information\, v
 isit their website at Glow Paddle 30A\n\nTimes\, the live map and the app:
  https://30anow.github.io/e/03567b25-9935-4a25-a304-87ce7d545564
URL:https://30anow.github.io/e/03567b25-9935-4a25-a304-87ce7d545564?s=cal
END:VEVENT
